      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are planning to use an ESPD (Scotland) for your procurement exercise, the same Word document template can be used for Route 2 or Route 3 procurements.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "ESPD Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Standarised Statements document can help you draft your ESPD (Scotland) if using this Word format, whilst more information on the ratios you can use are included in the ESPD Financial Ratios document.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "ESPD Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
